[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2749521617","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104512#issuecomment-2749521617","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104512","id":2749521617,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6j4l7R","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-24T22:15:26Z","updated_at":"2025-03-24T22:15:26Z","body":"Thanks for the report and the MRP.\n\nI can reproduce the issue in 4.4.stable and 4.4.1-rc2 (not a full freeze for me on Linux but there's significant lag).\nIn 4.3.stable, there's a slight lag on each sync of the remote debugger, but otherwise it's responsive.\n\nI tested intermediate dev snapshots, the issue seems to have been introduced in 4.4-dev4: https://godotengine.github.io/godot-interactive-changelog/#4.4-dev4\n\nSo it's likely to be a regression from #88427 too, like #102525, and thus likely indeed the same issue. But it wasn't clear from #102525 that the issue could still be reproduced so drastically after the mitigations we put in place.\n\nCC @KoBeWi ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2749521617/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2752540697","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104512#issuecomment-2752540697","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104512","id":2752540697,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kEHAZ","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-25T21:02:12Z","updated_at":"2025-03-25T21:02:42Z","body":"I tried profiling and don't see anything that would suggest icons as the cause. `CowData<TreeItem::Cell>::size` shows at the top.\n#88530 could be the culprit. The tree lags continuously, with icons being the problem it would be one big spike.\n(this also means that local tree should have the same problem)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2752540697/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2800256607","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104512#issuecomment-2800256607","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104512","id":2800256607,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6m6IZf","user":{"login":"jaydensipe","id":47132280,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTMyMjgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47132280?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe","html_url":"https://github.com/jaydensipe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-14T01:24:38Z","updated_at":"2025-04-14T01:24:38Z","body":"> I tried profiling and don't see anything that would suggest icons as the cause. `CowData<TreeItem::Cell>::size` shows at the top. [#88530](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/88530) could be the culprit. The tree lags continuously, with icons being the problem it would be one big spike. (this also means that local tree should have the same problem)\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3ee25e2b-a281-4725-8887-5be5139f11d4)\n\nThis does come from #88530, commenting out `_determine_hovered_item();` on line 5050 in tree.cpp gets rid of the massive freeze and brings the freeze time back to how it was in 4.3. The hovering still seems to work with this line commented out, but I'm sure there's some reason this is done in the create_item method?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2800256607/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2800840561","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104512#issuecomment-2800840561","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104512","id":2800840561,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6m8W9x","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-14T08:18:27Z","updated_at":"2025-04-14T08:18:27Z","body":"It ensures that created item is correctly hovered.\nIt doesn't need to be called every time though, it can be queued, so there is only one hover update when adding many items.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2800840561/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2800917145","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104512#issuecomment-2800917145","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104512","id":2800917145,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6m8pqZ","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-14T08:47:33Z","updated_at":"2025-04-14T08:47:33Z","body":"I opened a fix #105376\nCheck if it works for you.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2800917145/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.gi